{"id":"n14626-2-7","stage":2,"title":"말다 · 卷","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14626-2-7-1","ko":"김밥은 어떻게 만들어?","zh":"紫菜包饭怎么做？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김밥은","meaning":"紫菜卷饭，紫菜包饭","explanation":"김밥：紫菜卷饭，紫菜包饭；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"김밥","audio":"/audio/5a15efe8a053eb5a1b02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58106","senseId":"1","lemma":"김밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김밥은","audio":"/audio/d67635d59b7eb7030cfe.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"만들어?","meaning":"编，编制","explanation":"만들다：编，编制；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"2","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만들어","audio":"/audio/392fa24a03c8b6f27c3b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5a15efe8a053eb5a","term":"김밥","zh":"紫菜卷饭，紫菜包饭","audio":"/audio/5a15efe8a053eb5a1b02.mp3","entryId":"58106","definition":"用紫菜将米饭和各种菜包卷起来，再切成适当大小的食物。","pronunciation":["김ː밥","김ː빱"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"编，编制","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"写作或整理而集成一本。","pronunciation":["만들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fccafca0ac4350e2eb43.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14626-2-7-2","ko":"김 위에 밥과 다른 재료를 넣고 터지지 않게 잘 말면 돼.","zh":"把米饭和其他食材放在紫菜上，卷好，别把它卷破就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"밥과","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥과","audio":"/audio/52bceb97288cb085ba24.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"재료를","meaning":"材料","explanation":"재료：材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"재료","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71211","senseId":"1","lemma":"재료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재료를","audio":"/audio/aefc2eb191d91a1b2d12.mp3"}},{"text":"넣고","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣고","audio":"/audio/bc9dd322908f47e194c3.mp3"}},{"text":"터지지","meaning":"破裂，绽开，裂开，爆","explanation":"터지다：破裂，绽开，裂开，爆；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"터지다","audio":"/audio/463197edfeab332fb5d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91125","senseId":"1","lemma":"터지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading"